{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53364","headline":"杂句 十三 · 庞藴","name":"杂句 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心依真智，理逐心行，理智无碍，心亦无生。\n迷即有我，悟即无情。\n通达大智，诸法不成。\n五神无主，六国安宁。\n七死弗受，八镜圆明。\n随宜善化，总合佛经。\n过即已过，更莫再寻。\n现在不住，念念勿侵。\n未来未至，亦莫预斟。\n既无三世，心同佛心。\n依空默用，即是行深。\n无有少法，触目平任。\n无戒可持，无垢可净。\n洞达虚心，法无寿命。\n若能如是，圆通究竟。\n（以上七十五首皆见《庞居士语录》卷下）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53364.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53364","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}